nixos| |NixOS Modules Root (default.nix)|$DOTFILES_DIR/nixos/modules/default.nix
nixos| |NixOS Audio & PipeWire Quirk|$DOTFILES_DIR/nixos/modules/core/audio.nix
nixos| |NixOS Connections & Firewall|$DOTFILES_DIR/nixos/modules/core/connections.nix
nixos| |NixOS System Services|$DOTFILES_DIR/nixos/modules/core/services.nix
nixos| |NixOS Base System Settings|$DOTFILES_DIR/nixos/modules/core/system.nix
nixos| |NixOS User Accounts & Privileges|$DOTFILES_DIR/nixos/modules/core/user.nix
nixos| |NixOS Hardware Configuration|$DOTFILES_DIR/nixos/system/hardware-configuration.nix
nixos| |NixOS System Configuration|$DOTFILES_DIR/nixos/system/configuration.nix
